# Build context for ops/board-server/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# The context is the repo root. Without this, `COPY ops/board-server` takes .env (secrets in
# an image layer), target/, and valkey-data/, whose files Valkey writes 0600 as its own
# user: a non-root `docker compose build` then fails reading the context.
*
!shared/board.json
!ops/board-server
ops/board-server/target
ops/board-server/valkey-data*
ops/board-server/backups
ops/board-server/.env
ops/board-server/ops.env
ops/board-server/.alert-state
